'''Holly''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2018 Christmas box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is green in color with a small holly imprinted in the center, hence the name. The guard is red, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Holly Gun (2018)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Holly_Set Holly Set].
* There was a bug where if players equipped the [[Knifeception]] effect with this knife, small images of [[Sweater Knife (2018)]]’s decal would appear. However, this has since been patched. {{UncommonsNav}}

